People don't just disappear like that!

265
00:21:14,340 --> 00:21:15,170
Where'd he go?

266
00:21:15,660 --> 00:21:16,780
Show yourself!

267
00:21:17,860 --> 00:21:19,620
Looks like he pulled it off.

268
00:21:31,540 --> 00:21:33,500
I can't even see him!

269
00:21:33,820 --> 00:21:35,360
Is he moving that fast?

270
00:21:35,820 --> 00:21:36,840
Not quite.

271
00:21:37,300 --> 00:21:39,137
It's Stealth Black's special ability.

272
00:21:39,220 --> 00:21:40,985
He's able to become invisible.

273
00:21:41,580 --> 00:21:45,580
His suit projects an image of his
surroundings over his entire body.

274
00:21:48,020 --> 00:21:51,580
Even Sora, Warrior of the Sea,
had a hard time with this.

275
00:21:56,280 --> 00:21:58,180
Chairman really is the worst.

276
00:21:58,380 --> 00:22:00,439
Just whose side are you on, anyway?

277
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:03,160
Also, Law, you sound like a nerd!

278
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:06,009
I said, everyone from
the North Blue knows.

279
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:15,831
What's up with this suit?

280
00:22:16,220 --> 00:22:17,280
Did I disappear?

281
00:22:19,140 --> 00:22:21,460
It's almost like the clear clear fruit.

282
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:26,677
ever since i was little
i dreamed of becoming

283
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:31,400
invisible this is the one
this is the power i want

284
00:22:32,180 --> 00:22:35,160
but i watched that wish
crumble before my eyes

285
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:41,117
you thief you took nami and
then you stole my dream away

286
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:45,077
from me what the hell are you
talking about we've never even

287
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:50,037
met before you messed up i've
always wanted the skill of

288
00:22:50,120 --> 00:22:54,460
invisibility But you had to find
the clear clear fruit first.

289
00:22:54,780 --> 00:22:58,160
You took its powers and you
stole my wish along with it

290
00:23:00,080 --> 00:23:06,060
What that's why he's mad I
Thought my dream was dead

291
00:23:06,660 --> 00:23:10,960
Now I come to find out it's possible
with Germa technology of all things

292
00:23:12,060 --> 00:23:13,340
Irony's a bitch

293
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:17,780
This power will be quite useful

294
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:21,340
Think how easy it'll be
to sneak into the ladies,

295
00:23:21,560 --> 00:23:26,200
I mean, how much I'll be able
to help out all of my friends.

296
00:23:26,560 --> 00:23:27,920
Boy, what a dilemma.

297
00:23:41,560 --> 00:23:43,357
An invisible superhero?

298
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,980
Something's going on here.

299
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:49,860
You're not just some cook who
the hell are you in this form?

300
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:51,597
You'll have a harder time hitting me.

301
00:23:51,680 --> 00:23:54,660
Yeah, you can zip around fast who cares I

302
00:23:56,300 --> 00:23:58,457
Was planning to torture you nice and slow,

303
00:23:58,540 --> 00:24:01,716
but I suppose that I'd better
kill you quickly instead

304
00:24:21,900 --> 00:24:23,680
Jaggy, you awake?

305
00:24:27,620 --> 00:24:28,480
Get up!

306
00:24:28,700 --> 00:24:30,818
You got some extra dumplings for me?

307
00:24:30,940 --> 00:24:33,411
I'll repay you, so hand over what you got!

308
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:38,840
I know you're holding out on me, Jaggy!

309
00:24:58,900 --> 00:25:02,260
This room is ancient, quite curious.

310
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:06,440
A land isolated for centuries.

311
00:25:10,840 --> 00:25:13,600
These are the people
who created Poneglyph.

312
00:25:14,200 --> 00:25:15,612
Surely there's one here.

313
00:25:17,860 --> 00:25:20,213
Perhaps there's a secret door somewhere.

314
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:26,656
Are you looking for something, madam?

315
00:25:28,580 --> 00:25:31,340
I couldn't hear him at all. Who is this?

316
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:37,600
Go! Go!

317
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:40,060
Go! Go!

318
00:25:41,280 --> 00:25:42,357
It's your turn.

319
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:44,020
Show me what you can do.

320
00:25:44,340 --> 00:25:46,680
If that is what you desire, my lord.

321
00:26:03,200 --> 00:26:06,340
Tama, let's make this a
fair and friendly fight!

322
00:26:06,520 --> 00:26:08,900
You got it, Chapo Ramen! I'm ready!

323
00:26:12,840 --> 00:26:13,670
Ninpaw!

324
00:26:13,780 --> 00:26:14,740
Leaves Jutsu!

325
00:26:16,040 --> 00:26:17,360
Ha! Ninpaw!

326
00:26:18,900 --> 00:26:20,560
I'll dig-zag run!

327
00:26:34,080 --> 00:26:37,060
I'll never become a
bewitchy ninja at this rate.

328
00:26:37,220 --> 00:26:38,380
I'm so pooped.

329
00:26:40,220 --> 00:26:41,357
Job well done.

330
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:43,380
I had a hard time dodging it all

331
00:26:44,660 --> 00:26:45,980
Well done you two.

332
00:26:46,300 --> 00:26:48,100
I keep thinking about big bro.

333
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:49,475
I sure hope he's okay

334
00:26:49,940 --> 00:26:51,360
You don't have to worry.

335
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:53,421
Luffy will always come out on top

336
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:03,200
However, Ryza's correspondence
is alarmingly tardy.

337
00:27:03,300 --> 00:27:07,300
I'm a bit concerned My master told
me something that worried me too.

338
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:10,635
He said no one's ever come
back from the prison in Udon

339
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:12,880
Trust me, he'll be fine.

340
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:14,230
Neem, neem.

341
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:16,160
Focus on improving yourselves.

342
00:27:16,520 --> 00:27:17,755
That's all we can do.

343
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:20,299
Neem pose, tree climbing jiu-jitsu.

344
00:27:20,740 --> 00:27:22,020
Neem, neem, neem.

345
00:27:22,120 --> 00:27:23,355
I wish I were strong.

346
00:27:23,560 --> 00:27:25,797
I would simply retrieve
him myself right now.

347
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:27,380
Neem, neem, neem.

348
00:27:29,060 --> 00:27:29,890
Oh.

349
00:27:31,740 --> 00:27:34,152
There's something washed up on the beach.

350
00:27:34,840 --> 00:27:35,670
Hmm.

351
00:27:36,560 --> 00:27:37,660
Neem, neem.

352
00:27:43,300 --> 00:27:44,500
She's so skilled.

353
00:27:44,840 --> 00:27:47,537
So I wonder what the story
is behind that mask of hers.

354
00:27:47,620 --> 00:27:50,385
She wears it every time
she plays the shamisen.

355
00:27:54,860 --> 00:27:56,560
Yes, yes, that's the stuff.

356
00:27:56,980 --> 00:27:58,420
Now this is beautiful.

357
00:27:58,840 --> 00:27:59,840
I love it.

358
00:28:02,220 --> 00:28:03,050
Huh?

359
00:28:05,580 --> 00:28:06,933
We have you surrounded.

360
00:28:07,360 --> 00:28:10,772
You should consider your actions
in the presence of ninja.

361
00:28:11,980 --> 00:28:13,500
How bold.

362
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:18,616
It's possible that she's
never heard of ninjas before.

363
00:28:19,700 --> 00:28:21,600
She could be a foreigner.

364
00:28:37,040 --> 00:28:39,100
Good evening, Miss Geisha.

365
00:28:39,820 --> 00:28:41,702
Ah, getting into trouble, I see.

366
00:28:43,100 --> 00:28:44,865
I shall hear your explanation.

367
00:28:47,640 --> 00:28:48,937
Speak carefully.

368
00:28:49,020 --> 00:28:50,760
You've only one chance.

369
00:29:17,360 --> 00:29:19,500
This won't be easy after all.

370
00:29:19,980 --> 00:29:21,960
Ancient Zoans are pretty tough.

371
00:29:23,460 --> 00:29:27,401
However, it's going to take more
than that to defeat Stealth Black.

372
00:29:33,620 --> 00:29:35,100
That stung a bit.

373
00:29:35,380 --> 00:29:37,420
But this suit's pretty durable.

374
00:29:40,560 --> 00:29:43,325
The capital is going to
fall apart before I do.

375
00:29:47,100 --> 00:29:48,120
Let's go back!

376
00:29:48,400 --> 00:29:50,400
Why are we leaving Sangoro behind?

377
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:52,960
Because he gave us the okay to move on.

378
00:29:53,140 --> 00:29:55,081
Yeah, but he was just being cool.

379
00:29:56,920 --> 00:30:00,560
Time to wrap this up and bring
his lifeless body to Kyoshiro.

380
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:03,860
Still, I wonder who he really is.

381
00:30:12,740 --> 00:30:16,622
that's going to attract more
attention and likely more enemies too

382
00:30:17,140 --> 00:30:21,380
let's head to Ebisu town better
stay out of the capital a while

383
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:42,990
Huh!

384
00:30:46,280 --> 00:30:47,110
Huh!

385
00:30:49,820 --> 00:30:50,650
Huh?

386
00:30:53,900 --> 00:30:55,580
Shooting star!

387
00:30:56,040 --> 00:30:57,160
Soma King!

388
00:31:01,100 --> 00:31:01,930
What?

389
00:31:02,660 --> 00:31:03,700
Whoa!

390
00:31:22,820 --> 00:31:24,440
Nearly left to scratch.

391
00:31:27,420 --> 00:31:28,920
Where are you?

392
00:31:29,200 --> 00:31:30,060
Stop hiding!

393
00:31:31,580 --> 00:31:32,410
Supermask!

394
00:31:32,493 --> 00:31:33,900
Reveal yourself now!

395
00:31:35,320 --> 00:31:37,438
Guess I could get used to this name.

396
00:31:38,260 --> 00:31:42,025
I'll have to ask for Nosuke and
Usahachi for a redesign, though.

397
00:31:47,060 --> 00:31:48,080
It's this way!

398
00:31:48,280 --> 00:31:50,398
What do you think it is, Choborimon?

399
00:31:53,560 --> 00:31:54,960
Is that a person?

400
00:31:56,460 --> 00:31:58,040
They're colossal, if so.

401
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:02,020
But not quite giant size.

402
00:32:03,700 --> 00:32:06,994
Wow, it looks like they might
even be bigger than Kaido.

403
00:32:07,340 --> 00:32:08,920
Is that a woman?

404
00:32:09,280 --> 00:32:10,300
My goodness.

405
00:32:15,860 --> 00:32:17,340
It can't be!

406
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:30,260
What the heck's being mu -

407
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,711
Is there something wrong?

408
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:39,550
Psh!

409
00:32:39,633 --> 00:32:41,900
Keep it down or else
you'll wake her up! Run!

410
00:32:42,100 --> 00:32:43,924
If she sees us, we're done for!

411
00:32:44,480 --> 00:32:45,310
Huh?

412
00:32:45,393 --> 00:32:46,280
No, forget it!

413
00:32:46,480 --> 00:32:50,197
Even if we did run, she'd chase
us all the way to hell and back!

414
00:32:50,280 --> 00:32:52,100
I'm sorry, I don't understand!

415
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:55,426
Do you mean to say you
know who this woman is?

416
00:32:55,740 --> 00:32:56,570
Of course!

417
00:32:56,653 --> 00:32:57,740
Everyone knows her!

418
00:33:02,100 --> 00:33:04,740
