419
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:06,020
Lower your voice!

420
00:33:07,400 --> 00:33:09,220
So, who is Big Mom?

421
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:11,440
I'll explain everything later.

422
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:18,420
I can't hold back.

423
00:33:18,660 --> 00:33:20,420
I must kill her right now.

424
00:33:20,760 --> 00:33:23,642
I know she's asleep, but
think of her as a Kaido.

425
00:33:23,740 --> 00:33:25,800
She's just as dangerous as him.

426
00:33:33,020 --> 00:33:35,020
