430
00:34:02,260 --> 00:34:04,780
What is this?

431
00:34:06,580 --> 00:34:09,060
Who am I?

432
00:34:11,100 --> 00:34:12,440
Huh?

433
00:34:22,260 --> 00:34:23,090
Huh?
